==Notes==
This quest is only available during the time of [[Spring Eggstravaganza]].
==To Start==
Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
==Goals==
One of Alyssa's eggs has been hidden somewhere in Sacred Grove and she needs you to find it.
*Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
*Return to Alyssa Eggelyn.
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"A mean robgoblin took one of my eggs and hid them somewhere. Spring Eggstravaganza is around the corner and I need your help finding it." -Alyssa Eggelyn
#Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
#*The egg is located in the [[Briarwood Maze]] a short distance to the left of [[Snarling Hedges]].
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Wow I thought you would never find it. Your egg seeking abilities are eggsemplary and are deserving of one of my special eggs." -Alyssa Eggelyn
